content Compare strategy performance with/without intensity scaling.
	
	## Goal
	Measure the contribution of Avellaneda-Stoikov kappa to profitability.
	
	## Experiment Design
	- Run all datasets with -intensity 5m (default)
	- Run all datasets with -intensity 0 (disabled)
	- Compare Sharpe, profit, win rate, trade count
	
	## Expected Outcome
	- If intensity helps: better Sharpe with intensity enabled
	- If intensity hurts: overhead of complexity not worth it
	- If neutral: remove for simplicity
	
	## Analysis
	- Per-coin intensity impact
	- Per-dataset intensity impact
	- Interaction with other parameters (spread, skew)
